  "title": "Thai Fried Bananas",
  "description": "\"This is one of my favorite recipes. I have it every time I go to a Thai restaurant topped with coconut ice cream or drizzled with honey. If you have never tried it, now is the time, it's so good! I use Nam, a variety of banana that can be found at most Asian Markets. You can also use sweet potatoes in this recipe.\"",
